# The [D:lf-output] law at the repo boundary: committed bytes CHECK OUT
# as committed on every platform. Without this, a Windows runner's
# autocrlf converts LF artifacts at checkout — and a currency gate that
# byte-diffs a generated file against its committed copy (reference.json)
# fails on CR bytes weir never emitted. eol=lf overrides autocrlf; auto
# leaves binaries untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
